{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02286","headline":"杂曲歌辞 十二月乐辞 二月 · 李贺","name":"杂曲歌辞 十二月乐辞 二月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二月饮酒采桑津，宜男草生兰笑人。\n蒲如交劒风如薰，劳劳胡燕怨酣春。\n薇帐逗烟生绿尘，金翅峨髻愁暮云。\n沓飒起舞真珠裙，津头送别唱流水。\n酒客背寒南山死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02286.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02286","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}